mah se:, mah nimitstahtani *porque** teh tiki:xmati ne:,
<Sync time="416.649"/>
ka:mpa tinentinemi *o** xa: teihsá:
<Sync time="420.756"/>
kwaltiaskia,
<Sync time="423.011"/>
ita:kka xa: kwali se: kikwa:s,
<Sync time="427.154"/>
it..., ikowyo tein
<Sync time="430.225"/>
ima:tako:yo,
